Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[Esil gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] I surrender to you!\NPlease spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThat voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[metal clanging]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You won fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, will you let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NYou attacked us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you're begging for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After I killed all your men?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] A knight's solemn duty\Nis to protect their master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I live\Nto see another day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,they would be happy, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHappy they died?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NNow's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake\NI deeply regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you\Nanything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the entry permit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you get me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NYes, I certainly could!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My family is holding on\Nto the one for this floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,please consider it yours\Nas a token for sparing my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only that, I also know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,where the upper floor\Npermits are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guarantee my\Nand my family's safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be happy\Nto serve as your guide
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Your family's\Nhiding the permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NNow I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I trust anything\Ncoming out of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NO-of course, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I speak the truth,\NI'd never lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then, you agree\Nto give me the permit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll agree to leave in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NUh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not soon\Nforget this kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NBut would you mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,explaining just what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind howling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[gnawing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[fluttering]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] I am the eldest daughter\Nof the Radiru family, Esil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Cool, but not\Nexactly what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] I was hoping\Nshe'd give me more information
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,about the system,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,like what I learned from Barca.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you demons hear\Na voice in your heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Commanding you to slaughter\Nevery human you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NOh, umm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there is a voice,\Nbut it gives a different order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NWhich is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect this place\Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When did it start?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard it\Nsince our arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThey came from somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.19,0:04:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NThe demon realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, we woke up\Nand found ourselves here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThis demon realm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,what did you do there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] [static]\NWar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We were preparing\Nfor an imminent war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NA war?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Against who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,An adversary so strong\Nall demonkind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,had to unite to face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed a monumental war\Nwas on the horizon, when...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Permitted amount\Nof information exceeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Permitted amount\Nof information exceeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Permitted amount...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] I guess\Nthat's all I'm gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO JINCHUL]\NThis is the damage assessment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and combat log from\Nthe winged ant appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,on the nearby island\Nwithin Japan's borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred ninety-four\Ncivilians were killed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,by the ant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and one hundred eight\Nhunters deployed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to contain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As for hunter casualties,\Nthere were four E-ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a single C-rank, and a B-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think it was\Na colony's work, not one ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO JINCHUL] The decisive\Nfactor was an A-rank
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,who arrived on the scene later\Nand landed the fatal blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, one of these\Nmutated ants is on par
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,with an A-rank hunter, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That lines up\Nwith the conclusions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Surveillance\NTeam's necropsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NThe attack took place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,120 kilometers\Nfrom Jeju Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Should the ants gain any\Nfurther mastery over flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it will only be\Na matter of time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,before they reach the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact Japan\Nand request to join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach out\Nto our neighbors, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to raise\Nthe threat level ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO JINCHUL]\NYes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't put it off any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's already against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want this crisis handled\Nbefore any more lives are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, as chairman\Nof the Hunter's Association,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby initiate\Nthe fourth Jeju Island raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] I don't know why I\Nsuddenly passed out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry\Nfor the extra trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of you to ask,\Nconsidering...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NJust being polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:06:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[Esil sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] More importantly,\Nhow much further is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!\NIt's close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight\Nand you'll reach the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the entry permit\Nwill be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the blazes have you\Nallowed into our home, Esil?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He may appear to be one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But soldiers dwell\Nwithin his shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,hordes of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHuh, I'm impressed he noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have deceived her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is an attempt\Nto take our castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you dead first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter and I\Nhave an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the permit\Nfor the next floor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and nobody here\Nhas to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORGON]\NThis human must be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,who slayed Vulcan and Metus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't see\Nhow we could best someone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[deep breath]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Pleasure doing\Nbusiness with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORGON] Pleasurable or not,\Nthat "business" is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now begone\Nfrom my castle at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-There is one other thing.\N-Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to borrow\Nyour daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.57,0:08:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Oh, no,\Nno, no, no, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As a guide, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she knows where\Nto find all the entry permits
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,above this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathing heavily]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you won't let\Nany harm come to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this.\NRight, Esil?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[metal scraping]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[door opens]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guildmaster Goto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NNice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:08:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That wraps up the 89th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And for Tank and Igris,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that should mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,rank promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're comparable\Nto an A-rank and an S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Which rounds out\Nmy forces pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[glass clattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping this load\Nwould get lighter as we went,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't had to barter\Nfor our safe passage once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Wouldn't you\Nrather keep the treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought them to trade!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Elite nobles are stewards of\Nthe 90th floor and above,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stronger than anything you've\Nfaced up to this point, by far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But through negotiation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall secure the permits the\Nsame way you did with my--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Esil, if I'd been weaker\Nthan your family's forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,would you have agreed\Nto our deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThat's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You nobles are always\Ntrying to climb
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the hierarchy ladder,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to put your family\Nright at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Radi, uh, whatever family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Radiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But...Sir Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't obligated\Nto spare my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What made you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:09:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] [trembling]\N"Like?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NFirst Jinho, now her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I just get along\Nwell with people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,who have...\Na few toys in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah,\Nyou can head back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] You said the\Nenemies up ahead are no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I made a promise\Nto your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you tell me where to find\Nthe rest of the entry permits,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really find me\Nso useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] [chuckles]\NIt's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought\Nit'd be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done great.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,\NI'm staying with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see what you\Naccomplish with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NOnward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NEsil wasn't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a drastic spike\Nin difficulty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,on the 90th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Each encampment of demons,\Nboth in strength and numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,were quite literally\Non another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm keeping up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,clearing the floors\None step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the last\Ningredient for the elixir,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN]\NThe fourth Jeju Island raid
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,is in the works,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've both been\Nsummoned to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NOf course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN] President Baek\Nfrom the White Tiger Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,has also been called upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, every S-rank\Nfrom the country
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,should've received\Nan invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN] Which\Nwould include Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN] In addition,\Nthis raid will be an official
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,joint operation between\Nus and our close neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NYou mean Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN]\NI do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The recent attack\Nby one of these evolved ants
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,on Japanese soil proves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,they're as much\Nat risk as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the right call to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't care as long\Nas we kill every last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they set a date yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN]\NIt's still under consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but I doubt they'll take\Ntoo much time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak, hunters\Nfrom Japan's largest guild
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,are flying in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be meeting with\Nmembers of the Association
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to discuss strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NSo, this is the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] Doesn't seem\Nlike anyone's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps]\N-Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] That's him,\Nthe Demon Monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Baran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThat's one daunting aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-I can tell this won't be easy.\N-[wind gusting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL] His sheer bloodlust\Nis making me weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NEven Esil is feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And that creature he's on\Ncould be a problem too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A wyvern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he commands\Nmore than just demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThe gang's all here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have an idea,\Nnow would be the time to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sir Jinwoo!\N-Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NCome forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword slashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.17,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He never once showed\Nthis kind of strength
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on the floors below.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Demon Monarch Baran,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't just a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sir Jinwoo\Ninvaded his castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do I side with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Baran or Sir Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[ground rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[trembling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThat's no ordinary lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wide-range magic\Nwith a stun debuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can revive my soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but my mana will deplete fast\Nif keeps using that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So, before he can...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clip those wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw through Stealth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A homing attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's gaining on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tusk! Igris!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]\N[ground rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Sorry, but\Nlooking up was tiring me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Baran, you call\Nyourself a Monarch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Hanekawa
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and I belong\Nto the Drawn Sword Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Ryuji Goto-san,\Nour guild master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be interpreting\Nas he only speaks Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NThe Drawn Sword Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan's largest,\Nand with eleven S-ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,easily their strongest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Also said to be the second\Nlargest in all Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Their leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuji Goto, has an aura\Nthat more than lives up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to his\Nand his guild's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all,\Nthank you for inviting us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to join this new strike team\Nof allied forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We pledge our support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be the ones\Nthanking you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,for even agreeing to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We are truly grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As the documents\Nthat you've received state,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we've conducted\Nour own investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:16:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,into the winged ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's revealed a fair bit\Nof useful information.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could all turn your\Nattention to the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've provided a visual\Nto explain two critical points
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd like to touch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,One is their lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ants grow at an\Naccelerated rate after hatching
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but only live for about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nonce we exterminate the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the remaining ants will die off\Nwithin a year's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The second point is in regard\Nto their behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,From the previous three raids,\Nwe know that the ants
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,are drawn to stronger enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The more mana a hunter has,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the more attracted\Nthe ants are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As such, we'll organize\Nour strategy around that trait
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and use it against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] We've been\Naware of the ants' tendencies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but they've described them in\Nquite the elaborate breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANEKAWA] As for the plan,\Nyou'll of course need hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[speaking in Japanese]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANEKAWA] Of the Drawn Sword\NGuild's 11 S-ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,10 will be contributing,\Nand that does include myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Ndid you say 10 will help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] We'll act as a decoy\Nand draw out the ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That will leave\Nthe queen ant defenseless,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then your hunters\Ncould move in and finish her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This would require you\Nto fight thousands of ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're only creating\Na diversion, it should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And as AI simulations\Nhave proven,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,this plan has the highest\Nchance of success
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fewest deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] Ten S-rank hunters\Nis certainly more
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,than we would be able to field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no one here opposed,\Nlet's begin tactical planning
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,with that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] I don't even have\Ntime to down a potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sung Jinwoo growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHe blocked Fatal Strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThere goes all my mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[thunder rumbling]\N[rain splattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sung Jinwoo growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!\NMy daggers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHe's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[metal creaking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[Esil gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NNow's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use all of my strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and combine it\Nwith Ruler's Hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.30,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sung Jinwoo sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[ESIL]\NAre you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NEsil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Head home and give\Nyour dad this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, the Radish family\Nruns this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Radiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Radish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
